<title>USA: AMP Inc Q4 net loss after $0.58/shr charge.</title>
<headline>AMP Inc Q4 net loss after $0.58/shr charge.</headline>
<dateline>HARRISBURG, Pa. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.18   profit	 $0.52</p>
<p> Net loss		  40,000   profit     113,779</p>
<p> Net sales	    1,403,000		1,297,985</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 219,760		  217,845</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 includes $195 million (pre-tax) restructuring and other charges, $125 million of which were non-cash charges. These one-time charges cut Q4 earnings by $0.58 per share.  </p>
<p>			 12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $1.31   profit	 $1.96</p>
<p> Net profit	     287,000   profit     427,334</p>
<p> Net sales	    5,468,000		5,227,226</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 219,597		  217,716</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 year results include $195 million in pre-tax restructuring and other special charges.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk, 212 859-1736</p>
</text>
